WEBVTT

25:01.283 --> 25:02.783
I'd better take a look anyway.

25:03.910 --> 25:06.370
Why is that soldier
strapped to an explosive device?

25:06.455 --> 25:08.706
That's why, Sid.

25:09.833 --> 25:11.167
Sure is a hairy fellow.

25:11.251 --> 25:13.294
No, no, that's Scud, you idiot.

25:13.628 --> 25:15.796
That is Sid.

25:17.048 --> 25:19.800
-You mean that happy child?
-That ain't no happy child.

25:19.885 --> 25:23.137
He tortures toys, just for fun!

25:26.308 --> 25:28.809
Well, then we've got
to do something.

25:29.311 --> 25:30.728
What are you doing?
Get down from there!
